OL,3,GNEWSATeenager taken to hospital after
OL,4,AGlasgow shopping centre gang attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who was attacked by a gang
OL,7,Fof youths inside a Glasgow shopping
OL,8,Fcentre has been treated in hospital for
OL,9,Fhis injuries.
OL,11,FVideo posted on social media shows the
OL,12,Fyoung man, who was using a crutch and
OL,13,Fwearing a medical boot, being knocked
OL,14,Fto the ground, then repeatedly punched
OL,15,Fand kicked inside the St Enoch Centre
OL,16,Fon Friday afternoon.
OL,18,FA second person was also pushed to the
OL,19,Fground but security staff intervened.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
